<title>USA: Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on all three of the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices fell this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.38 percent, down 15 basis points from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.31 percent, down 14 basis points.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.68 percent, down 10.</p>
<p>					Latest Previous Last Date</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.38%    5.53%  7/10/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.31%    5.45%  7/10/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.68%    5.78%  7/10/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
